## Future platform discovery

The current offering is intended to be retired in the future. No retirement date or migration timetable is announced here, and discovery does not mean the current service has closed.

A separate discovery is exploring observability needs across Modernisation Platform, Cloud Platform, and other Ministry of Justice teams. It does not announce a selected product, approved future architecture, or replacement ready for use.

Read [about the discovery](/discovery/index.html) and [how to contribute](/discovery/get-involved.html).
